# Build context of the root Dockerfile (the web app and the server in one image).
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
deploy
.playwright-mcp
*.log
# Settings files never go into the image, including apps/web/.env.local, which
# the web build would otherwise read.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Runtime artefacts a developer machine accumulates inside the server tree.
# They must never reach the image: the log files carry the full params of
# failed cloud functions, and files/files is the local FSFilesAdapter store,
# which Docker would seed a fresh docustamp-files volume from.
logs
apps/server/logs
apps/server/files/files
apps/server/exports
**/*.err.*
**/*.info.*
